      "settings": {
        "back_text": "Back",
        "custom_title": "Round Air-Lift Stool with Backrest - 31200",
        "intro_highlight": "Handcrafted in North American facilities to rigorous structural standards, this station eliminates daily spinal strain by pairing smooth, instant pneumatic adjustment with superior practitioner-focused ergonomics.",
        "custom_description": "<p>The <strong>Round Air-Lift Stool</strong> is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Estheticians, Lash Technicians, and Cosmetic Injectors. Its precision-engineered pneumatic gas lift targets postural strain and lower-back tension during high-volume clinic days, enabling sharper focus on treatment execution and service consistency. Whether you are performing deep-pore cleansing, brow sculpting, or detailed facial procedures, this treatment equipment adjusts to your seamless workflow integration with friction-free adjustment and instant-response calibration.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Ergonomic Adjustable Backrest & Pneumatic Air-Lift",
        "secondary_description": "<p></p><p>High-grade structural integrity is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the ultra-white finish and pristine surface integrity of the Round Air-Lift Stool, clean the surface daily with neutral, alcohol-free sanitizers formulated for commercial spa environments. The heavy-duty vinyl covering features high stain resistance and tear resistance, ensuring pristine physical condition across years of continuous daily use. Consistent care prevents premature surface cracking, maintains fluid pneumatic cylinder operation, and extends overall equipment life.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
        "show_color_option": true,
        "show_size_option": false,
        "featured_product": "round-air-lift-stool-31200",
        "btn_label": "ADD TO CART",
        "show_compare_btn": true,
        "compare_btn_label": "Compare with other models"
      }
    },
