          "settings": {
            "question": "Esthetics & Skincare:",
            "answer": "<p>Provides the stable, mobile base required for detailed facial analysis and micro-treatments, allowing practitioners to maintain an optimal 90-degree leg angle while the backrest provides critical lumbar support during 60+ minute sessions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Spa & Wellness:",
            "answer": "<p>Ideal for technicians performing laser hair removal or skin rejuvenation. The 360-degree swivel and ultra-quiet casters allow for seamless transitions between the treatment console and the client</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Specialized Bodywork:",
            "answer": "<p>For specialists managing long-duration procedures, the air-lift height adjustment (20.5\" to 27.5\") ensures the stool can be paired with any standard or high-low treatment table, maintaining ergonomic alignment throughout the day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
