          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the height adjustment range of the Round Air-Lift Stool?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>It adjusts smoothly from 20.5 inches to 27.5 inches.</strong> This accommodates standard facial tables and low workstation setups.</p>"
